// PY-A: 字符串方法补齐 —— ljust/rjust/center（含 fillchar）+ 字面量模板 .format()
//   （ljust/rjust 曾只在 3 元数表里 → 2 参调用落空；fill 是字符串句柄而非字节）
// expect: [ab   ]
// expect: [   ab]
// expect: [  ab  ]
// expect: [ab---]
// expect: [**ab**]
// expect: [1 and x]
// expect: [{9}]
// expect: [b-a]
print("[" + "ab".ljust(5) + "]")
print("[" + "ab".rjust(5) + "]")
print("[" + "ab".center(6) + "]")
print("[" + "ab".ljust(5, "-") + "]")
print("[" + "ab".center(6, "*") + "]")
print("[" + "{} and {}".format(1, "x") + "]")
print("[" + "{{{}}}".format(9) + "]")
print("[" + "{1}-{0}".format("a", "b") + "]")
